  "body": "MILLWATER | PROFESSIONALS\r\n\r\n**Professionals Real Estate looks forward to welcoming you home.**\r\n\r\nIf space, comfort and a great location are high on your wish list, this home deserves your attention. Positioned in the popular Millwater community, this well-designed home offers everything busy families need, with generous living spaces, a practical layout and room for everyone to enjoy.\r\n\r\nThere's plenty to love, from the modern kitchen and multiple living areas to the private outdoor entertaining space. Whether it's family time, entertaining friends or simply enjoying some downtime, this home delivers flexibility and comfortable everyday living.\r\n\r\nProperty features include:\r\n* Four generous bedrooms, including a master with ensuite\r\n* Two bathrooms, ideal for busy family life\r\n* Modern kitchen with island bench and walk-in pantry\r\n* Open-plan kitchen, dining and living\r\n* Separate lounge for added space and flexibility\r\n* Private outdoor patio, perfect for weekend BBQs\r\n* Double internal-access garage with additional attic storage\r\n* Ducted air conditioning for year-round comfort\r\n* Fully fenced section, ideal for children and pets\r\n\r\nThe separate lounge is a welcome bonus, while the open-plan living area creates a natural hub for family connection. Combined with good storage, an easy-care layout and excellent functionality, this is a home designed to make everyday living easy.\r\n\r\n**Need to sell before you buy? There may be some flexibility here, so get in touch to discuss your options.**\r\n\r\nMillwater continues to be a popular choice for families, with parks, walkways and everyday amenities close by. Silverdale's shopping, cafes and restaurants are within easy reach, while Orewa Beach is just a short drive away. In zone for Silverdale Primary, and Orewa College and close to Kingsway Junior, Senior and Stella Maris, school options are aplenty. Add access to main transport routes, and you have a location that ticks all the boxes.\r\n\r\nOur vendors are on the move and encourage your early interest. If you've been searching for a spacious, well-appointed, yet affordable family home in a sought-after location, get in touch with Sarah today. We look forward to showing you through!\r\n\r\n**Attention Agents: Bring your buyers - we offer competitive conjunctional rates to all agencies.**\r\n\r\n**Experienced. Trusted. Consistent. Local Professionals**\r\n\r\nAuction on site 13th December 2026 (unless sold prior)",
